  message: "Fixed + merged (PR #285, selfh/dev 95840f1780). Behavioral evidence: before, _get_results_cache_dir returned a byte-identical path (analyzer_identity 5ca857265b4683d3) after a simulated grammar upgrade -> stale cache hit. After, compute_analyzer_identity_hash folds tree-sitter library + grammar package versions (schema._detect_tree_sitter_versions); production-path tests test_hash_changes_when_grammar_version_changes + test_hash_changes_when_tree_sitter_library_version_changes assert the hash now shifts on a grammar/lib version change, and test_hash_handles_absent_tree_sitter covers the no-tree-sitter path. Tradeoff documented: global identity over-invalidates (any grammar upgrade rebuilds whole cache once); per-language granularity deferred as future optimization."  # fe22
